<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end slightly up,focus on French vote.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end slightly up,focus on French vote.</headline>
<text>
<p>1525 GMT - Bonos close slightly higher on Friday, despite Buba remarks, as dealers squared books ahead of French vote</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 104.66 vs 104.51, yield 6.84 vs 6.69</p>
<p>* June bond future 114.80 vs 114.62 at yesterday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.64/67 vs 84.66/69</p>
</text>
